MACRO P                                                                         
* &P.SUPERSESSION                                         1       A             
* &P.SUPERSESSION                                         1       A             
    &P.IDARTNR                                            1     5 P  0          
*                         *** PART NUMBER REPLACED                              
    &P.REKSIFFR                                           6     1 P  0          
*                         *** CHECK DIGIT                                       
    &P.DIERS-ERS                                          7     4 P  3          
*                         *** QUANTITY REPLACED                                 
    &P.TIERSDAT                                          11     3 P  0          
*                         *** SUPERSESSION DATE                                 
    &P.KDERS                                             14     2 P  0          
