    &P.IDKORTNR                                          16     2 P  0          
*                         *** CARD NUMBER FOR SUPERSESSION INFO                 
    &P.FLTEXT                                            18     1 A             
*                         *** IF FLTEXT = J TYP2 INFORMATION                    
*                         ***       ELSE    TYP1 INFORMATION                    
    &P.TYP1                                              19    20 A             
      &P.IDARTNR-TILLK                                   19     5 P  0          
*                         *** REPLACING PART NUMBER                             
      &P.DIERS-TILLK                                     24     4 P  3          
*                         *** REPLACING QUATITY                                 
      &P.REKSIFFR-TILLK                                  28     1 P  0          
*                         *** REPLACING CHECK DIGIT                             
      &P.FILLER01                                        29    10 A             
